  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0: Conversation/chat summarization. New CavemanTextRank.RankAndSummarizeChat(text) cleans a full chatbot/LLM transcript (markdown + JSON), segments it into blocks and applies TextRank only to long natural-language discourses that exceed a configurable quota, while keeping short service results / keyword lists verbatim (tunable via ChatSummarizeOptions). CavemanConversationToText now extracts HTML inner text as plain text (decoding entities) instead of dropping it. Licensed under the Caveman License (MIT + mandatory attribution); bundled data under Universal Dependencies terms (see NOTICE).",
